    <briefdescription>
<para>AES-256-GCM encryption decorator for <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1storage_1_1_i_blob_storage_backend" kindref="compound">IBlobStorageBackend</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wraps an existing backend; all data is encrypted before being forwarded to the underlying store and decrypted transparently on retrieval.</para>
<para>Thread-safe: protected by an internal <computeroutput>std::mutex</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
